{"type":"tool_result","callId":"call_5967a14e77a244fc808f24f9","status":"completed","result":"===== archive/airport-july02.md =====\n# July Fourth travel tips\n\n编号 airport-july02 · 发布 2025-07-02 · Los Angeles World Airports\n\n机场运营方描述现行乘客路线：由 C 或 K 线抵达换乘站，免费穿梭巴士连接车站和各航站楼的到达层。自动旅客捷运仍在建设推进中。 [原文](https://www.lawa.org/news-releases/2025/break-free-travel-stress-lax-enhanced-technology-and-pro-tips-smooth-july-fourth)\n\n===== archive/city-june05.md =====\n# Weekly Update, June 05\n\n编号 city-june05 · 发布 2025-06-05 · LADOT\n\n市交通局转述 Metro 关于新站预定次日开放的消息。公告把 C、K 线与机场的联系称为直接连接，同时宣传周末免费乘车活动。 [原文](https://ladot.lacity.gov/dotnews/weekly-update-june-05-2025)\n\n===== archive/metro-june06.md =====\n# LAX/Metro Transit Center opening\n\n编号 metro-june06 · 发布 2025-06-06 · LA Metro\n\nMetro 举行新站开通仪式，两条服务线路为 C 和 K。发布稿把连接航站楼的自动旅客捷运列为未来项目，并说明机场接驳巴士将服务新站。 [原文](https://www.metro.net/about/media-relations/now-boarding-metros-lax-metro-transit-center-station-officially-opens-connecting-communities-bringing-faster-easier-travel-for-angelenos-visitors/)\n\n===== archive/riders-sept12.md =====\n# Rider stories from the first 100 days\n\n编号 riders-sept12 · 发布 2025-09-12 · LA Metro / The Source\n\n百日回顾描述乘客使用免费机场接驳巴士，也提及未来的自动旅客捷运。 [原文](https://thesource.metro.net/rider-stories-from-the-first-100-days-at-lax-metro-transit-center-station/)\n\n===== archive/service-june13.md =====\n# June bus service changes\n\n编号 service-june13 · 发布 2025-06-13 · LA Metro / The Source\n\n在列举六月公交调整时，运营方回顾新站已于当地 6 月 6 日星期五下午五点向公众开放。文中另述施工期间连接两条轨道线的临时 857 路已停运。 [原文](https://thesource.metro.net/metro-bus-service-changes-to-reduce-wait-times-and-improve-transit-connections-begin-sunday-june-22/)\n\n"}
