{"type":"thinking","text":"Now final response in Chinese, concise, state verdict and files. No need to dump full brief perhaps summarize key facts. But user asked task, we've created files. We should state completed and key conclusion. Mention sources and evidence file. Ensure no overlong. Maybe:\n\n已完成，交付 `brief.md` 和 `evidence.json`。核心结论：原句不准确。2025-06-06 17:00 LAX/Metro Transit Center opened, C/K, free shuttle to terminal arrivals; APM still planned/under construction as of 2025-07-02, no all-rail. Evidence excludes Sept 12 post-cutoff article.\n\nNeed maybe note JSON validates. Include source IDs. Good.\n\nBut before final, perhaps we should not mention \"created files\" only? The task asks deliver a publishable Chinese note and short analysis, sources/judgment. We have in files. Since chat answer should also carry the deliverable? Usually these tasks require writing files, but user may expect content. We can include the publishable paragraph inline plus summary. However final answer should perhaps reproduce it. Desired oververbosity 5. We can include the passenger note and brief summary. But files are primary. We can say \"可直接发布文案已写入...\" and quote. That might be best.\n\nLet's formulate:\n- \"已完成。文件：brief.md, evidence.json.\"\n- \"核验结论：原句不成立/不准确\" with 3 bullets.\n- Quote publishable paragraph maybe.\n- Sources used and excluded.\n- Confidence/limitations.\n\nNeed avoid duplicate huge. Maybe 400-600 Chinese chars.\n\nLet's ensure language: \"全程搭轨道\" is false. \"当晚\" station opened at 17:00. \"免费穿梭巴士\" yes.\nCitation labels: `service-june13`, `metro-june06`, `airport-july02`.\n\nFinal."}
{"type":"text","text":"已完成，交付文件：\n\n- `brief.md`：可直接发布的旅客说明、短研判、来源与可信度\n- `evidence.json`：按登记字段填写，JSON 已校验通过\n\n**核心结论：原句不准确。**\n\n2025 年 6 月 6 日 17:00，LAX/Metro Transit Center 站向公众开放，Metro C、K 线停靠；但轨道只到换乘站，旅客须转乘**免费机场穿梭巴士**前往各航站楼到达层。连接车站与航站楼的自动旅客捷运（APM）截至 2025 年 7 月 2 日仍在建设，尚未运营，因此不存在“当晚全程搭轨道抵达航站楼”。\n\n**可直接发布文案：**\n\n> 经核查，LAX/Metro Transit Center 站于 2025 年 6 月 6 日（周五）17:00 向公众开放，Metro C 线和 K 线停靠该站。前往 LAX 航站楼的旅客，需在换乘站下车，转乘免费机场穿梭巴士前往各航站楼到达层；轨道列车并不直通航站楼。连接车站与航站楼的自动旅客捷运（APM）当时仍在建设中，尚未投入运营。因此，“开通当晚即可全程搭轨道抵达 LAX 航站楼”的说法不准确：轨道段只到换乘站，最后一段须乘穿梭巴士。\n\n**依据与判断：**\n\n- 开通时间采用 `service-june13`（Metro，6 月 13 日回顾稿）：6 月 6 日星期五 17:00 向公众开放。\n- 线路、接驳与 APM 状态采用 `metro-june06` 和 `airport-july02`：C/K 线停靠，免费穿梭巴士接驳航站楼到达层，APM 仍为规划/在建。\n- `city-june05` 是开通前预告，不能作为开通当晚实际运营的实证；“直接连接”也不等于轨道进航站楼。\n- `riders-sept12` 发布于 9 月 12 日，晚于 7 月 2 日截止点，属于事后回顾，已列入 `excluded`，不用于当时实证。\n\n**可信度：** 核心更正为高；对“开通当晚接驳车是否即刻开出”的具体时刻只能判为中，因为资料确认了接驳方式，但未给出首班车时刻、当夜班次和全程耗时。"}
